  <item>
    <title>Ep19.别劝了，嗑CP真的能治愈一切！我们是“中女嗑学家”❤️</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68492e03b23ed76e607b3be1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68492e03b23ed76e607b3be1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jun 2025 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><strong><span>“你看了他对她笑了一下，你就完了。”</span></strong><br><span> </span><strong><span>——嗑CP的快乐，不止年轻人懂，中女嗑起来，更是上头上瘾无法自拔！</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>这一期的《此时此刻 Here &amp; There》，</span><strong><span>Belle和Emma带你深入解剖“嗑CP”这门“情感哲学”</span></strong><span>，从瑞士遥控推荐王安宇 x 刘浩存，聊到英剧封神《Normal People》、禁忌之恋《Fleabag》、甜出心病的《Heartstopper》、灵魂互撞的《Call Me by Your Name》和《断背山》……</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬 为什么我们爱磕“bad ending”的爱情？</span><br><span>💔 为什么有些CP一秒相视就让人动心？</span><br><span>🌈 什么样的情感关系最容易被投射、共鸣、幻想？</span><br><span>🔮 CP文化背后，其实藏着我们对“理想感情”的最大渴望和投影！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目的 </span><strong><span>精彩程度等同于英剧结尾一句“i'll go”“i'll stay”带来的情绪原地爆炸。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🌟听这一期，你会重新理解——</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>“爱，不是拥有，是你曾感受过那一瞬心动。”</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你也是磕CP上瘾的“中女磕学家”📚，或者你对“爱为何总难如愿”有过自问，那这一期，不容错过。</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>⏳时间轴内容索引：</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:00:45</a></span></strong><span>｜Belle为啥突然疯狂安利一对CP？Emma震惊：你什么时候开始嗑CP的！</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">00:03:19</a></span></strong><span>｜英剧《Normal People》全解析：青春遗憾+灵魂相吸＝天花板CP 💘</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">00:06:06</a></span></strong><span>｜Bad Ending 为何让人更上头？这剧的结尾，是磕学巅峰！</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="793">00:13:13</a></span></strong><span>｜Emma的磕点大公开：《Fleabag》的神父+禁忌之恋=情绪爆裂</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">00:18:06</a></span></strong><span>｜《Nobody's Watching》推荐：又一个拉扯系神作 🔥</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">00:22:02</a></span></strong><span>｜Belle化身腐女讲解《Heartstopper》：青春纯爱+LGBTQ甜得冒泡🍬</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1612">00:26:52</a></span></strong><span>｜腐女磕点大公开：不是谁在一起，而是那种模糊又致命的在乎</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1939">00:32:19</a></span></strong><span>｜聊聊相亲市场：爱情成了精致“配置”里的被边缘项？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2110">00:35:10</a></span></strong><span>｜古偶剧vs英美剧：国产爱情剧的爽点为何让我们get不到？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2309">00:38:29</a></span></strong><span>｜我们真的还相信爱情吗？嗑到心碎，是因为我们太懂了 ❤️‍🔥</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>想知道为什么</span><strong><span>中年才真正理解爱情的复杂与纯粹</span></strong><span>？想找回那个曾经为一句“i love you”心跳漏拍的自己？👇</span><br><span> </span><strong><span>马上点播收听这一期，《此时此刻 Here &amp; There》与你一起共磕真爱！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🎧 </span><strong><span>两位中女主持的高能嗑学课，已上线！别错过！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
