    <pubDate>Thu, 08 May 2025 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>👩🏻‍💼👩🏼‍💼 职场是什么？是暗潮汹涌？是温柔乡？还是无法逃离的修罗场？</span><br><span>本期《此时彼刻Here &amp; There》，Belle和Emma带你穿越</span><strong><span>中美欧三地职场</span></strong><span>，深度解码：</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔥 《黑镜》第七季ep02：当隐性职场霸凌刺痛你，还能微笑打卡吗？</span><br><span>🔥 Belle直击美国Greensboro分公司，亲身体验"梦中情厂"：暖到发烫的人性关怀💖，弹性工作制自由到飞起🏃‍♀️——绝对称得上全球最佳职场！！</span><br><span>🔥 瑞士职场vs美国职场：清冷秩序🧊与热情文化🔥的正面对撞</span><br><span>🔥 中国职场现状大起底：</span><strong><span>团建KPI化</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>加班内卷化</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>996甚至007常态化</span></strong><span>，——为什么越来越多人选择自由职业？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧠 我们一起聊：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>什么样的公司，能让你真正"想留下来"？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>如何判断你的职场，是燃烧自己，还是成就自己？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>友谊在职场中，是真实存在，还是幻觉？💭</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>💬 带着真实故事，带着犀利吐槽，带着温柔的期待——</span><br><span>这一期，让我们一起，重新想象：什么才是理想的工作生活？🌍</span><br><span> </span><br><span>⏰</span><strong><span>时间线:</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a>｜聊《黑镜》第七季：隐形职场霸凌与职场环境隐喻</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a>｜Belle亲访美国Greensboro分公司：梦中情厂的真实日常</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a>｜瑞士职场 vs 美国职场：清冷理性与人情温度的对比</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a>｜什么是真正的Work-Life Balance？欧洲企业的弹性探索</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13">00:13</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a>｜中国外企团建文化观察：团建KPI与真实连接的断层</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a>｜如何打造认同感？Greensboro分公司的日常善举文化</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a>｜卷文化深剖：中美职场加班现象与隐形压力链条</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a>｜裁员与安全感：瑞士与国内企业裁员机制大不同</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a>｜失业保障与自由选择：瑞士社会制度的职场支撑力</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a>｜年轻人逃离大厂：自由职业、价值感与新职业理想</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> - <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="53">00:53</a>｜大公司文化异化与职场友谊的可能性反思</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>👂 点击播放，你的职场思考，或许从此不一样！</span></p>]]></description>
