  <item>
    <title>Ep14.世界上最孤独的比赛，和我们内心的海——重新认识孤独</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f9c852623bc78c391758a8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f9c852623bc78c391758a8</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 20 Apr 2025 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果让你一个人在海上漂</span><strong><span>114天</span></strong><span>，没有补给、没有人说话、没有救援，你能坚持几天？🌊</span></p><span></span><p><span>在这一期的《此时彼刻Here &amp; There》，</span><strong><span>Belle 和 Emma</span></strong><span>带我们踏上一场关于</span><strong><span>极限挑战与深度孤独</span></strong><span>的航程，聊的不是旅游，不是冥想，是</span><strong><span>全球最孤独的比赛</span></strong><span>——</span><strong><span>旺代环球帆船赛（Vendée Globe）</span></strong><span>⛵️。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏅 单人无协助、无停靠，连续漂流两三个月</span><br><span>🌍 瑞士选手如何在“无海国家”备战世界第一？</span><br><span>👀 这项比赛为什么被称为“孤独的朝圣”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>但话题远不止海面之上。我们一起探讨：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>🤯 为什么有人</span><strong><span>主动选择孤独</span></strong><span>？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🧠 孤独如何影响我们的精神状态与人格类型？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🫂 瑞士的宁静与“冷漠”，如何重塑一个“外向中国人”？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🎬 从《Into the Wild》《Fleabag》到《Sex and the City》，电影里最动人的孤独瞬间你记得吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🧘‍♀️ Emma：Silent Retreat五天不说话，她真的疯了？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>🏔 Belle：想象中最理想的独处，是一间山中木屋还是瑞士的湖边？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎙️两位主播真实坦露内心，笑中带泪，冷静中带思辨，聊出了**“孤独”的高级感与疗愈力**。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“独处不是沉默，是与你灵魂最真诚的对话。”</span></strong><br><span>这期内容值得反复听，让你重新理解孤独，也可能，重新理解自己。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>🕰 </span><strong><span>时间线索引：</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a></span></strong><span> ⛵️ 揭秘Vendée Globe：世界最硬核比赛</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a></span></strong><span> 👩 瑞士女选手如何备战无海国家的海上赛？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">03:29</a></span></strong><span> 🧠 孤独到底是惩罚还是选择？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a></span></strong><span> 😱 安全保障靠参赛者自己？惊心动魄细节揭秘</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a></span></strong><span> 🧘‍♀️ 孤独是一场精神修行，还是一场自我放逐？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">08:42</a></span></strong><span> 🧗‍♂️ 徒手攀岩 vs 海上漂流：谁更孤独？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a></span></strong><span> 🦢 Belle在瑞士的孤独体验：和天鹅说话的日子</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="746">12:26</a></span></strong><span> 🧬 MBTI人格测试：谁最不适合“瑞士式孤独”？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="841">14:01</a></span></strong><span> 🤯 尼采也疯了？瑞士安静得令人崩溃</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a></span></strong><span> 🎧 夜店、热闹与孤独：年轻人在瑞士怎么活？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a></span></strong><span> 🎥 孤独的影视瞬间：Fleabag、松子、Miranda的圣诞夜</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1203">20:03</a></span></strong><span> 📚 Into the Wild：被毒死的理想主义者</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1321">22:01</a></span></strong><span> 🧠 现代人为什么越来越喜欢独处？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a></span></strong><span> 🪞 内观的力量：独处，是建立底气的方式</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1631">27:11</a></span></strong><span> 🏃 极限运动为何让人上瘾？真正的挑战是自己</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a></span></strong><span> 🤐 Emma的极限：Silent Retreat她能忍几天？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1864">31:04</a></span></strong><span> ✅ 孤独VS独处：其实是两回事</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1890">31:30</a></span></strong><span> 🎤 结语：下期我们聊点热闹的！</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
